v 3
d 'balreport': Two-group descriptive statistics and covariate balance report
d
d Continuous summaries: mean (SD) and median (Q1, Q3).
d Categorical summaries: N (%); diagnostics: SMD and variance ratio.
d Supports weighted percentiles, Excel export and configurable precision.
d Requires Stata 18 or later; no community-contributed dependencies.
d
d Author: Toshiharu Mitsuhashi
d License: MIT
d GitHub: https://github.com/sankyoh/balreport
d Version: 1.1.0
d Distribution-Date: 20261019
d
f balreport.ado
f balreport.sthlp
f sample.do
